text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M00_Text_08186B71 {
    "Hm, so they doubled the guests by\nusing POKéMON as attractions?\pHm, well, maybe I should make a cute\nPOKéMON our inn’s mascot.\pI wonder if that will attract more\nguests to stay with us?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M00_Text_08186C2B {
    "Oh, sorry, sorry!\nI was too involved in watching TV!\pSince that TEAM {AQUA} came to town,\nthe tourists have been staying away."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M00_Text_08186CA6 {
    "Hey, down in front!\nI can’t see the TV!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M00_Text_08186CCE {
    "Amazing! You’re telling me a POKéMON\nfound someone’s lost item?\pThat’s something. If we had some smart\nPOKéMON like that...\pWe could recover anything that our\nguests mislaid..."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M00_Text_08186D7F {
    "Oh, sorry, sorry!\nI was too involved in watching TV!\pI heard that someone busted the\nTEAM {AQUA} HIDEOUT.\pThanks to that, we just booked a\nreservation from a big group.\pIt was a company called... Uh...\nGAME something..."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M00_Text_08186E57 {
    "Amazing! A house-sitting POKéMON\ncaught a burglar?\pThat’s something. If we had a tough\nPOKéMON as a security guard...\pWe would be able to provide our guests\nwith greater safety."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M00_Text_08186F09 {
    "Oh, sorry, sorry!\nI was too involved in watching TV.\pOh, yes. A big group of guests arrived\na little while ago.\pThey booked in as GAME FREAK, so I\nguess they must make games.\pUh-oh, I’d better get working on\ntheir dinner!"
}
